Thanks Harihar for benchmarking logistic regression. It'll be great if you could also describe the hardware setup you used (number of machines, memory etc.) and the number of partitions of data used.

FWIW it looks like we have mostly linear scaling for logistic regression and I just created a JIRA to track the problem with word count. https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-135

Thanks
Shivaram

