Subject: [JIRA] (SPARKR-136) SparkR should use SPARK_LOCAL_DIRS
Message-ID: <Mme3jnqF_8s.NK5Dg_Fkt2sJ@sparkr-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/sparkr-dev/c/Mme3jnqF_8s/m/NK5Dg_Fkt2sJ>
