Re: Installation failure hadoop 2.4.0 <https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-138>

Hmm I haven't seen these before, but the one easiest to debug might be install-dev.sh. Here are something things that might be useful to check

1. Is there enough free disk space ? Some of these errors seem like they could be caused by that
2. Could you attach the complete output of install-dev.sh ? It would be good to see which zip file entry can't be unzipped
3. Could you also specify the Java version and Java home that you have on the machine ?

