> > > > > > > >>>>> Problem #3
> > > > > > > >>>>>
> > > > > > > >>>>> Finally, I noticed that SparkR seems to use /tmp on the slave nodes,
> > > > > > > >>>>> putting large files there. On my EC2 cluster, / only has 7 Gb, while /mnt
